Component Testing > Browser Mode for Component Testing: Component testing in Vitest uses **Browser Mode** to run tests in real browser environments using Playwright, WebdriverIO, or preview mode. This provides the most accurate testing environment as your components run in real browsers with actual DOM implementations, CSS rendering, and browser APIs.
